# House C++ style: LLVM (2-space indent, 80 columns) — matches the existing
# C++/MLIR sources. Enforced on CHANGED LINES via `make fmt-check`
# (git clang-format against the PR base); existing code is grandfathered and
# reformatted only when touched, so adopting the policy needs no mass reformat.
# See docs/testing/STATIC_ANALYSIS.md.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
